{"4052190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ballad of the Midnight Man", "steam_appid": 4052190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/f084195a5635b6280d31c8c8180eab5b.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"About the Game\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are resting peacefully in your comfy bed, under your warm duvet, dreaming about being a successful rock star (or something. I don't know).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air around you becomes chilly, and you wake up. Your eyes adjust to the inky blackness and you see the thing that possibly woke you up—a dark entity in the corner of your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entity's wide, bulging eyes are glued to your form. Despite its frightening appearance, it appears to stay still and doesn't seem to have harmful intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until it shows you its row of teeth in a Cheshire-like grin. Its claws jut out of its fingers, as big as kitchen knives. It starts approaching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to get out of there. <strong>FAST</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/2ee9e155badfc28dbffb706d28c935c6.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"Features\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror-comedy visual novel. Your decisions determine your fate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different chapters (Elevator Game chapter is still work-in-progress). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different endings for Midnight Mayhem chapter, including a bonus scene if you obtain all endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design and sound effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-pounding original soundtrack by <strong>Lady Belles-lettres</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original songs by <strong>Lady Belles-lettres</strong> featuring Synthesizer V vocal synths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and creepy art by <strong>Lady Belles-lettres</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tall, monstrous entity who is low-key obsessed with you :D</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game contains loud noises and flashing visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/63333715f1038e12417c4263a47b1b40.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"Meet the Cast\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/e7d7ff3f946657b01eb22f78d3e98976.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"A headshot of the main character, Sarah\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras_big/e7d7ff3f946657b01eb22f78d3e98976.webp?t=1772800903 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sarah </strong>- Our main and playable character! She was having a lovely night sleep in her bedroom until something woke her up in the middle of night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrouded in darkness, Sarah stares at the thing in the corner of her room. Is that a person? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has sharp teeth and claws... A... m-monster...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Sarah survive the night and see daylight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/9a351bb3e3270798902f954c6dddf93c.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"A headshot of Sarah&#039;s sister, Katie\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras_big/9a351bb3e3270798902f954c6dddf93c.webp?t=1772800903 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katie </strong>- Sarah's younger sister. Probably spends too much time on Tumblr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She loves horror and creepypastas and playing those darn Internet rituals and games. Could she have something to do with the creature in Sarah's room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/5de214d1feaf5a3b72f7c8e62d45dc05.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"A headshot of the antagonist, The Midnight Man\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras_big/5de214d1feaf5a3b72f7c8e62d45dc05.webp?t=1772800903 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Midnight Man</strong> - The 8 foot tall entity in Sarah's bedroom with sharp fangs and talons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are its intentions? Who knows? All Sarah knows is that she HAS to get out of that room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/4d01d22fe871b98ce8528f25242b3042.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"A headshot of the Red Lady\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras_big/4d01d22fe871b98ce8528f25242b3042.webp?t=1772800903 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Red Lady of the Elevator Game</strong> - ?̶̡̟̭̝͋͋?̴̟̤͠?̴̫̪̊̈͗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/0bb2377b8941163a6ea5883af16d9b55.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"Credits\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >General Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direction and coding - Lady Belles-lettres<br>Writing - Lady Belles-lettres<br>Music - Lady Belles-lettres<br>Art and UI - Lady Belles-lettres<br>Mixing and mastering - Cross Couloir</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voice Acting Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vocal Synth Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah - SOLARIA II<br>The Midnight Man - HXVOC<br>Mom - Mai 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLARIA II and HXVOC are developed by Eclipsed Sounds. Synthesizer V 2 and Mai 2 are developed by Dreamtonics. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/f084195a5635b6280d31c8c8180eab5b.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"About the Game\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are resting peacefully in your comfy bed, under your warm duvet, dreaming about being a successful rock star (or something. I don't know).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air around you becomes chilly, and you wake up. Your eyes adjust to the inky blackness and you see the thing that possibly woke you up—a dark entity in the corner of your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entity's wide, bulging eyes are glued to your form. Despite its frightening appearance, it appears to stay still and doesn't seem to have harmful intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until it shows you its row of teeth in a Cheshire-like grin. Its claws jut out of its fingers, as big as kitchen knives. It starts approaching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to get out of there. <strong>FAST</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/2ee9e155badfc28dbffb706d28c935c6.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"Features\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror-comedy visual novel. Your decisions determine your fate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different chapters (Elevator Game chapter is still work-in-progress). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different endings for Midnight Mayhem chapter, including a bonus scene if you obtain all endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design and sound effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-pounding original soundtrack by <strong>Lady Belles-lettres</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original songs by <strong>Lady Belles-lettres</strong> featuring Synthesizer V vocal synths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and creepy art by <strong>Lady Belles-lettres</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tall, monstrous entity who is low-key obsessed with you :D</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game contains loud noises and flashing visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/63333715f1038e12417c4263a47b1b40.avif?t=1772800903\" alt=\"Meet the Cast\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052190/extras/e7d7ff3f946657b01eb22f78d3e98976.a